sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as API server
    participant Store as Job status store
    participant Queue as Job queue
    participant Worker as Worker pool

    Client->>API: Submit job with idempotency key
    API->>Store: Record status: accepted
    API->>Queue: Enqueue the job
    API-->>Client: Job ID returned immediately
    Worker->>Queue: Dequeue the job
    Worker->>Store: Update status: running, then done or failed
    Note over Worker: Retries are capped; poison jobs move to the DLQ
    Client->>API: Poll job status with the job ID
    API->>Store: Read current status
    API-->>Client: Status, and the result when done
